{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14c50","nodeId":"ArOoKuf9scAURs8NRjAru","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Data Warehouse\n\nA data warehouse stores structured, processed data from operational systems, optimized for analytical queries. It typically uses columnar storage and is populated through ETL or ELT processes. Common cloud data warehouses include Google BigQuery, Snowflake, and Amazon Redshift.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What Is a Data Warehouse?","url":"https://www.oracle.com/database/what-is-a-data-warehouse/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5304"},{"type":"video","title":"What is a Data Warehouse?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4tK2ttdSDg","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5305"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/ArOoKuf9scAURs8NRjAru.md"}